  "reply": "Make sure the zip code you entered is correct; if it still returns no results, try searching by the pharmacy’s phone number. When adding a custom pharmacy, fill in all required fields (Name, Address, Phone, Fax) and then click Save. If the Save button stays disabled, verify that you have a Medical Assistant or Provider role and that all mandatory address fields are completed. After saving, refresh your browser cache (Ctrl+F5 or Cmd+Shift+R) to see the new entry in the drop‑down list."
